      },
      "message": "test(#622): pins for pole clicks snapping the roll to the nearest quarter turn\n\nRed on main: toward([0,0,1]) reads atan2(0,0)=0 whatever the pre-click\nyaw, and basis_right's pole guard pins screen-right to literal +X, so a\nTOP/BOT click spins the model up to half a turn on screen. These pins\ndemand the snap law: yaw to the nearest FRAC_PI_2, right (-sin y, cos y,\n0) at the pole, post-click up within 45 degrees of pre-click up, and a\nsecond pole click that changes nothing. Decision in\ndocs/decisions/622-viewcube-roll-snap.md.",
